<html>
	<head>
		<title>Spill the beans, man.</title>
		<font name="hilaricons" src="/Hilaricons.woff2">
		<font name="trebuchetms" src="/TrebuchetMS.woff2">
		<icon src="gurt://localhost/hotfnx512.png">
		<style>
			body {
				bg-[#ddd]
				w-full
				font-trebuchetms
			}
			
			#idemfk {
				w-full
				flex
				flex-col
				items-center
			}

			#info {
				bg-[#eee]
				w-1/2
				p-5
				rounded-[20px]
				mt-20
			}
			
			p, h1, h4 {text-center font-trebuchetms}
			
			p {text-sm}
			
			h1 {text-6xl}
			
			h4 {font-bold}
			
			#icon {text-center font-hilaricons}
			
			#rowful {
				flex
				justify-center
				items-center
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div id="idemfk">
			<div id="info">
				<h1 id="icon"><%- String.fromCodePoint([0xf7692, 0xf7685, 0xf7693, 0xf7695, 0xf7682][Math.floor(Math.random()*5)]) %></h1>
				<div style="h-5"></div>
				<h4>Spill the beans.</h4>
				<div style="h-5"></div>
				<p>What do you exactly mean by "<%- a.split("").map(function(a){return`&#${a.codePointAt(0)};`}).join("") %>"?</p>
				<div style="h-5"></div>
				<div id="rowful"><p>Okay Mr. Funnyman, to the&#160;</p><p><a href="/">homepage</a></p><p>. Now!</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>